---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import kitchenImg from '../assets/callie-kitchen.jpg';
---

<section id="callie">
  <div class="wrap letter-grid">
    <div class="letter-photo rv">
      <div class="tape"></div>
      <div class="frame">
        <Image
          src={kitchenImg}
          alt="Callie in her kitchen"
          widths={[400, 600, 860]}
          sizes="(max-width: 880px) 90vw, 430px"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="letter-body">
      <span class="kicker">A note from your coach</span>
      <h2>She's not a bot. She's been there.</h2>
      <div class="creds">
        <span>Functional Nutritionist</span>
        <span>Blood Chemistry Certified</span>
        <span>Mom of Two</span>
      </div>
      <p
        >I'm Callie. I've done the 2am math on milk supply and calories. I've
        lived the 4pm snack spiral. And professionally, I've watched the advice
        women get after birth swing between starvation dressed up as discipline
        and vague permission with no plan.</p
      >
      <p
        ><strong>Macros and Mamas is the program I needed and couldn't find.</strong
        > I read your intake myself. I build your ranges myself. I'm in the group
        coaching thread Monday through Friday, usually in voice notes, and when
        your week blows up, I answer your 1:1 myself. Not a chatbot wearing my
        name.</p
      >
      <p
        >And this really is a family thing. The app was built at our kitchen
        table by my husband, or as the mamas in the group call him, The Tech
        Guy. We're a young family figuring it out like you are, which is exactly
        why the program bends around real life instead of pretending you don't
        have one.</p
      >
      <p
        >Eight weeks with me, and you won't just weigh less. You'll know what
        your plate looks like for the rest of your life.</p
      >
      <div class="letter-sig">
        <span class="script">Callie</span>
        <span class="role"
          >Founder &amp; your coach<br />Macros and Mamas</span
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
